# 10.4 BillingCenter

## What is BillingCenter?

**BillingCenter** is Guidewire's billing and receivables system. It manages the complete billing lifecycle — invoicing, premium payments, installments, delinquencies, collections, and refunds — with configurable billing plans and automation.

## Core Capabilities

| Capability | Description |
|---|---|
| **Invoicing** | Automated invoice generation per billing plan |
| **Payments** | Multi-channel payments (ACH, card, check) |
| **Installment plans** | Monthly, quarterly, annual, custom schedules |
| **Delinquency** | Grace periods, late fees, cancellation triggers |
| **Collections** | Work queues, payoff calculations, schedules |
| **Audit/GL** | Accounting integration, premium ledger |

## Billing Lifecycle

```
Policy Issuance → Invoice → Payment → Delinquency (if unpaid) → Collection → Close
```

| Stage | Activities |
|---|---|
| **Billing Creation** | Billing plan assigned from PolicyCenter |
| **Invoice** | Auto-generate on schedule |
| **Payment** | Apply payments, partial payments, reversals |
| **Delinquency** | Grace period, notices, fees |
| **Collection** | Work queue, payoff, cancellation if required |
| **Close** | Final paid status, refunds if endorsed |

## Billing Plans

| Plan | Characteristics |
|---|---|
| **Annual** | One invoice per year |
| **Semi-annual** | Two installments |
| **Quarterly** | Four installments; usually small fee |
| **Monthly** | Most common for auto & homeowners |
| **Pay-as-you-go** | Auditable premium, monthly adjustments |
| **Custom** | Configurable by product/line/state |

## Payment Processing

| Channel | Description |
|---|---|
| **Agent billing** | Agency bill, statement-based |
| **Direct bill** | Policyholder pays carrier directly |
| **ACH/EFT** | Automated bank debits |
| **Credit card** | Online/IVR card payments |
| **Check** | Lockbox, manual |
| **IVR** | Automated phone payments |

## Delinquency & Collections

| Feature | Purpose |
|---|---|
| **Grace period** | Statutory/contractual days before lapse |
| **Delinquency triggers** | Missed payment thresholds |
| **Notices** | Automated cancellation/warning letters |
| **Collections queues** | Route accounts by severity |
| **Cancellation** | Non-pay cancellation with reinstatement rules |
| **Reinstatement** | Fee calculation, effective date logic |

## Key Integrations

| Integration | Purpose |
|---|---|
| **PolicyCenter** | Policy changes drive billing adjustments |
| **ClaimCenter** | Recovery payments, claim expense billing |
| **Accounting/ERP** | GL postings, premium ledger |
| **Payment gateways** | Card/ACH processing, reconciliation |
| **Collections agencies** | Work item handoff |

## BillingCenter Roles

| Role | Responsibilities |
|---|---|
| **Billing Analyst** | Account reconciliation, adjustments |
| **Collections Agent** | Delinquency outreach, payment plans |
| **CSR** | Payment questions, refunds |
| **Manager** | Aging reports, KPIs |

## Summary

- BillingCenter manages invoicing, payments, installments, and collections.
- Billing plans are configurable per product/state.
- Integration with PolicyCenter and ClaimCenter keeps premiums current.
- Delinquency and collections workflows automate regulatory compliance.

